# Required — used to sign session JWTs. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=

# Optional — only needed if deploying under a non-default URL
# NEXTAUTH_URL=

# Required only for `pnpm start` / a production deploy (Vercel sets this
# automatically on its own domains; set it explicitly elsewhere).
# Not needed for local `pnpm dev`.
AUTH_TRUST_HOST=true

# Not needed for any of the pages this demo currently wires up (they run on
# an in-process mock store, see src/lib/mock-store.ts). A handful of routes
# not yet migrated off the original private backend still call this at
# request time and will 500 if it's unset — safe to leave unset for now.
# API_URL=
